            "text_KediFe": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h4>TANGHULU was conceived in the vibrant atmosphere of <strong>New York City</strong> and flourished in the dynamic landscape of <strong>Boston</strong>. Our mission is simple yet profound: to <strong>redefine the nail experience</strong> for individuals of all ages and identities.</h4><h4>For decades, the beauty industry has been limited by traditional salon visits—time-consuming, expensive, and often lacking flexibility. We saw an opportunity to create <strong>a perfect substitute for nail salons</strong>—a solution that offers salon-quality nails without the hassle. That’s how TANGHULU was born.</h4><h4>We specialize in <strong>handcrafted press-on nails</strong> that combine artistry with innovation. Our goal is to empower individuals with a beauty experience that is <strong>effortless, long-lasting, and customizable</strong>.</h4>",
