            "text_LcBezb": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>The future of TANGHULU is <strong>bigger than nails</strong>. We envision a world where <strong>press-on nails become the go-to alternative to salons</strong>, offering a <strong>lifetime nail salon experience at home</strong>.</p><p>💡 <strong>Our Upcoming Plans:</strong><br/>🚀 <strong>Expanding Our Product Line</strong> – More nail art designs, beauty tools, and accessories.<br/>🏢 <strong>Physical Retail & Nail Bars</strong> – Bringing the TANGHULU experience to in-person spaces.<br/>🌍 <strong>Global Expansion</strong> – Making TANGHULU a worldwide leader in beauty innovation.</p><p>We are on a mission to <strong>redefine the way people experience nail beauty</strong>—one press-on set at a time.</p><p>✨ Join us in shaping the future of nails! ✨</p><p>📲 Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tanghulunails/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Instagram\">Instagram</a> & <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@tanghulunails?lang=en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Tiktok\">TikTok</a> @Tanghulunails<br/>💌<a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" title=\"Contact us\"> Contact Us</a> for Custom Orders & Collaborations</p>",
